  "interpretation_zh": "稠密 full-DCT K2 在五相机和九相机两臂均达到 1313/1313 严格安全单元与 13/13 完整标定组，说明这个稠密起点再做一步 CGLS 的诊断精度充足。但冻结的 Zero-K4 参考在两臂均为 0/1313 和 0/13，不具备作为接受参考的基本精度。",
  "interpretation_en": "Dense full-DCT K2 reaches 1313/1313 strict-safe cells and 13/13 complete calibration groups in both sensor arms, showing that this dense starting point followed by one additional CGLS step is diagnostically accurate. However, the frozen Zero-K4 reference reaches 0/1313 cells and 0/13 groups in both arms and is not an adequate accepted reference.",
  "decision_boundary_zh": "按结果前冻结的判决顺序，参考不足必须先记 inconclusive。因此不能由 full-DCT K2 的绝对过门推出算法成功、exact-call 减少或速度收益，也不能在 v196 内事后换参考。下一步只能先审计之前被接受的 reference 身份。",
  "decision_boundary_en": "The result-blind adjudication order requires an inadequate reference to produce an inconclusive verdict before candidate headroom is considered. Therefore the absolute full-DCT K2 pass cannot establish algorithm success, exact-call reduction, or speedup, and v196 cannot replace the reference post hoc. The next action is limited to auditing the identity of the previously accepted reference.",
  "route_action": "Retain full-DCT K2 as a strong post-open diagnostic clue, invalidate the current Zero-K4 comparative contract, and audit the prior accepted reference identity before freezing any new gate. Keep p14, tests, resource measurement, predictor training, neural training, and GPU use closed.",
